This directory contains modified copies of two Apache-2.0 packages:

- eve 0.40.0 (vendor/eve), Copyright 2026 Vercel, Inc. and contributors
- @workflow/world-postgres 5.0.0-beta.35 (vendor/workflow-world-postgres), Copyright Vercel, Inc.

Their original LICENSE and NOTICE files are kept in each package directory.

The Osinara project changed files in both packages. The changes were first applied as install-time
patches (scripts/apply-eve-patches.ts, removed when these copies were vendored on 3 October 2026)
and are maintained here since then; the repository history shows every change. Files named
osinara-*.js are added by the Osinara project and built from scripts/eve-runtime/.
